-- exit: 1
-- The checker refuses a function of too many parameters and bounds
-- before it reads its signature: the refusal comes with the other
-- errors of the module, and the function's body and its callers say
-- nothing more of it.
-- stderr-contains: error[compile]: too many parameters and bounds of a function: 256 (the limit is 255)
-- stderr-contains: error[type]: type mismatch
-- stderr-not-contains: .silt:15:
-- stderr-not-contains: .silt:20:
trait Tr {
